==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichis]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Healer (Enemy)|Healer]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that even the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] are able to beat, although you will need some support as Healer has 299,999 health.

